Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:02:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] presentation: size panorama columns by readable cover width

Use available width, density and cover aspect ratio rather than viewport area. Keep compact wide grids at two columns and fit typical expanded portrait/landscape widths at two/three. Shared Mihon math has the same old area-based limitation; defer its independent release outside this Anikku task.
